azure:cdn/frontdoorBatchRuleSet:Frontdoo.description:
Manages a Front Door (standard/premium) Batch Rule Set.

> **Note:** This resource creates the Front Door Rule Set in batch mode and manages the full ordered batch rule collection for it. Any change to the configured <span pulumi-lang-nodejs="`rule`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`Rule`" pulumi-lang-go="`rule`" pulumi-lang-python="`rule`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`rule`" pulumi-lang-java="`rule`" pulumi-lang-hcl="`rule`">`rule`</span> blocks sends the desired final ordered rule list to the Resource Provider in a single request.

